# diverts_demo

cast WREN
  .label "Wren"

-- start

WREN
  Where to?

  * Up the lighthouse
    -> lighthouse
  * Down to the docks
    -> docks

-- lighthouse

> The stairs are damp under bare feet.

WREN
  The light's been out since Maren left.

-> ending

-- docks

> The boats lean against each other in the slack tide.

WREN
  Quiet morning. Nobody's gone out yet.

-> ending

-- ending

WREN { soft }
  Either way, the bell's not going to ring itself.
